WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[No dialogue. Ambient score.]
Aurora moves over a dark winter forest.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Icebergs drift across a glacier lagoon.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A jagged peak rises above black dunes on the east coast.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
From the air, summits break through a sea of cloud.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Waves fold onto a black sand beach.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The northern lights ripple over the ice.
Edge of North. Where the map runs out.
